8.1 The Pack is provided "as is" and "as available", without any express or implied warranty, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, non-infringement, or freedom from viruses or errors.
8.2 We make no warranty regarding compatibility with your devices, saves or third-party mods.
