10.4 An Exception License is valid only for the named party and the stated purpose, is non-transferable, and must be reapplied for upon expiry or change of purpose.

## 11. Termination

11.1 Any breach of this Agreement automatically terminates the license granted to you.
11.2 Upon termination you must immediately stop using the Pack and delete all copies.
11.3 Sections 6, 8, 9, 12 and 13 survive termination.
11.4 The CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license granted under LICENSE-ASSETS is not terminated by termination of this Agreement; however, a breach of that license may terminate it.

## 12. Modification

12.1 We may revise this Agreement; a revised version takes effect for subsequent versions upon publication in the repository.
12.2 Non-commercial licenses already obtained under a previous version are not affected.
12.3 If you do not agree to a revision, you must stop using the Pack.

## 13. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution

13.1 The formation, validity, interpretation, performance and dispute resolution of this Agreement are governed by the laws of the People's Republic of China.
13.2 Disputes arising from this Agreement shall be resolved through friendly negotiation; failing which, either party may bring an action before the competent people's court at the place where the project maintainer resides.

## 14. Miscellaneous

14.1 Severability. If any provision is held invalid or unenforceable, the remaining provisions remain in effect, and the provision shall be interpreted, to the extent permitted by law, so as to give effect to its original intent.
14.2 Entire Agreement. This Agreement, together with LICENSE-ASSETS and the licenses of Third-Party Components, constitutes the entire agreement between the parties regarding the Pack and supersedes prior oral or written statements.
14.3 Language. The Chinese version prevails. The English translation is for reference only; in case of conflict, the Chinese version controls.
14.4 No Waiver. Our failure or delay in exercising any right under this Agreement does not constitute a waiver of that right.

